Z||000000||Will||07-07-2000||02:37 PM||||V8 Archie has an IMSA Fiero for sale at <A HREF="http://www.v8archie.com/imsafs.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.v8archie.com/imsafs.htm</A> <P>I am interested in the widebody fenders for front and rear. Does anyone know how much wider than stock these fenders are? IOW, how much wider can I make the wheels/track for front or rear?<P>Also, what are the widest 17" wheels with 3 inch front spacing that will fit on an '88 front suspension?||||reg||1
